@startuml
title Sequence - UC-06 Scenario Writing with Internal GEC
skinparam shadowing false
actor Learner
participant Browser
participant "Next.js Route Handler\n/api/ai/gec" as BFF
participant "Internal GEC API\nFastAPI /v1/gec/correct" as API
participant "T5-small GEC" as Model
participant "Deterministic Diff" as Diff

Learner -> Browser: Submit scenario text
Browser -> BFF: POST text + scenario_code
BFF -> BFF: Read server session and apply 8s timeout
BFF -> API: Bearer JWT + bounded request
API -> API: Verify JWT and validate input
alt request valid and model ready
  API -> Model: Generate corrected_text
  Model --> API: corrected_text
  API -> Diff: Align original and corrected text
  Diff --> API: corrections/error_type
  API --> BFF: Success + metadata
  BFF --> Browser: Validated response
  Browser --> Learner: Safe original/corrected diff
else invalid/auth/model error
  API --> BFF: Standard error envelope
  BFF --> Browser: Mapped recoverable error
  Browser --> Learner: Retry/validation state
end
@enduml
